{"3664960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brugmansia", "steam_appid": 3664960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Mark — a writer and photographer searching for inspiration.</strong><br>A nighttime road through endless fields leads you to a private estate deep within a dying forest. A sudden storm, a deer in the headlights, a crash, a stalled engine — and a single house glowing in the darkness. With no signal, no help, and nowhere else to go, you step inside. The gate slams shut behind you. That’s when everything goes wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This abandoned refuge feels almost inviting at first. But soon the air shifts, the house decays, memories twist, and reality fractures. Rot blooms beneath the wallpaper. Bodies appear where no one should be. Flowers whisper through the walls, intoxicating the air with confusion and terror. Something in this place is alive, hungry — and waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The further you go, the less the world resembles itself.</strong><br>Rooms rearrange. Hallways stretch. Visions crawl out of the dark. What started as a search for creative spark becomes a struggle for survival, sanity, and truth. In the depths of the estate lies the source — a presence feeding on minds and turning flesh into roots. To escape, Mark must uncover its origin, create an antidote, and decide how the story ends: extinguish the house, or let it consume him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Atmospheric psychological horror<br>— Exploration, tension, and narrative discovery<br>— Reality distortion, hallucinations, shifting environments<br>— Environmental puzzles and item-based progression<br>— A final choice with consequences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A house forgotten by the world.<br>A forest suffocated by silence.<br>A writer who came looking for inspiration — and found something far worse.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Mark — a writer and photographer searching for inspiration.</strong><br>A nighttime road through endless fields leads you to a private estate deep within a dying forest. A sudden storm, a deer in the headlights, a crash, a stalled engine — and a single house glowing in the darkness. With no signal, no help, and nowhere else to go, you step inside. The gate slams shut behind you. That’s when everything goes wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This abandoned refuge feels almost inviting at first. But soon the air shifts, the house decays, memories twist, and reality fractures. Rot blooms beneath the wallpaper. Bodies appear where no one should be. Flowers whisper through the walls, intoxicating the air with confusion and terror. Something in this place is alive, hungry — and waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The further you go, the less the world resembles itself.</strong><br>Rooms rearrange. Hallways stretch. Visions crawl out of the dark. What started as a search for creative spark becomes a struggle for survival, sanity, and truth. In the depths of the estate lies the source — a presence feeding on minds and turning flesh into roots. To escape, Mark must uncover its origin, create an antidote, and decide how the story ends: extinguish the house, or let it consume him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Atmospheric psychological horror<br>— Exploration, tension, and narrative discovery<br>— Reality distortion, hallucinations, shifting environments<br>— Environmental puzzles and item-based progression<br>— A final choice with consequences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A house forgotten by the world.<br>A forest suffocated by silence.<br>A writer who came looking for inspiration — and found something far worse.</p>", "short_description": "Writer Mark heads to a prestigious l